proving nginx can only be accessed through port 443:
curl -k https://jasnguye.42.fr:443 -> works
curl -k https://jasnguye.42.fr:444 or 80-> does not work  
also we can have a look into the yml file to prove that we only exposed 443

proving we are using ssl/tls: openssl s_client -connect jasnguye.42.fr:443 -tls1_2

proving I can only access https and not http
